Large stone windmills mark a series of three pastures connected by road to Dominula, Windmill Village in the east. These fields rest upon cliffs along the northern edge of the Altus Plateau, north of the ravine containing the Woodfolk Ruins and a Minor Erdtree. The Road of Inquiry extends west toward Mt. Gelmir, while a southbound route across the divide was severed by the collapse of the Forest-Spanning Greatbridge.

The villagers are celebrating a delightful festival.
